title: CultistIntro1
---
Welcome to your maze, my liege. You have crafted a particularly sadistic trap, I must say. I wish I could say that your maze is inescapable, but alas it is not.
===

title: CultistIntro2
---
If the humans are able to reach their goal rooms, they will retrieve a key. After that, they can escape through the ritual room. 
===

title: CultistIntro3
---
You can find each human's objective in the journal I have provided to you. You will also record their fears as you discover them. 
===

title: CultistIntro4
---
If you wish to get to know the humans better, I implore you to read the backstories I have provided. It is only part of the story. It is up to you to discover the rest.
===

title: DispatchTutorial1
---
Greetings again, my liege. I come to offer you options on how to operate your cult. 
===

title: DispatchTutorial2
---
We can gather more information on the humans, grow our cult, or exert influence on your maze, among other things. The choice is yours, my liege. If you choose to unlock an ability, it will appear in your bookmark.
===